  unitName: Aerigila
  unitId: 20661
  unitNumber: 1160
  description: A migratory bird native to Ishgria. It favors waterfront areas, and
    is able to store enormous amounts of water inside its body. As a result, its
    body and wings remain wet no matter how long it is in flight. It is said that
    many desert animals will prioritize hunting this bird on spotting it. It feeds
    primarily on small animals, but has been known to attack even humans with its
    razor-sharp claws when hungry.
